em\"><!----> <div class=\"ProductTabBar__firstTabItemMobile__eKv82\"><span>\n                  Tính năng\n                </span></div> <ul class=\"ProductTabBar__subTabListMobile__mrIWV\" style=\"height:0px;\"><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem firstTabItem ProductTabBar__firstTabItem__FE3gO\"><span>\n                    Tính năng\n                  </span></li> </ul></li> <li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thông số kỹ thuật\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS ProductTabBar__active__N4qFo\"><span>\n                Giải thưởng\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thư viện\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Nơi mua\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Hỗ trợ\n              </span></li></ul></div></div> <!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__productAwardPage__DePl3\"><!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__awardTabs__2vloX\"><ul role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" style=\"width:1520px;\"><li aria-selected=\"true\" aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards tabpanel-video tabpanel-media\" id=\"All\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(4)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202604141801278920796.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Excelent\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Vandal Online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Excelent</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Designed by Hideo Kojima\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>01/06/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Media review Award of Excelent\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://vandal.elespanol.com/noticia/1350786320/el-hardware-mas-bonito-de-2026-asus-y-kojima-revelan-su-pc-gaming-disenada-por-el-artista-de-metal-gear/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202509090438294340916.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9.0\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      GamingProfessors.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9.0</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The limited edition gaming peripherals with Kojima Productions design are easy to rate. Asus simply took quality premium hardware and enriched it with a beautiful design endorsed by a beloved development icon. The ROG Keris II Origin-KJP mouse impresses with excellent precision, low weight, and great control. The ROG Delta II-KJP headset will please with its sound quality and connectivity. The Scabbard II XXL-KJP then represents exactly the kind of mousepad you'd expect from its price category. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>02/13/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Media review Award of 9.0\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gamingprofessors.cz/rog-delta-ii-kjp-rog-keris-ii-origin-kjp-a-rog-scabbard-ii-xxl-kjp-prislusenstvi-od-asusu-v-barvach-kojima-productions-recenze/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004030029140950082.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Diamond award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC AXE\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Diamond award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      In this review, we had the opportunity to get acquainted with ROG products created in collaboration with Kojima Productions, with a heavy emphasis on design and build quality. The ROG Delta II headphones feature a futuristic design and offer high comfort thanks to the quality of the materials used.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>04/05/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Media review Award of Diamond award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://axe.rs/hardver/periferije/asus-rog-kojima/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202504172033116270560.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Platinum award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      SS MODS\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Platinum award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It offers all the latest sound and connectivity capabilities, but the details that adorn them, such as the inscriptions inside the headphones indicating which is left or right, are something rarely seen. The height and tilt adjustments are totally ergonomic, and there is no way you won't be able to adjust them to fit your head size.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>03/29/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset Media review Award of Platinum award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ss-mods.com/rog-x-kojima-jedinstveni-hardver-biti-poseban/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:none;\"></div> <!----> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(2)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI ProductAwardMedia__mediaItemLessThanThree__UaUrc\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"VseSmart.cz\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202504010018045030816.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      These are headphones where I found it hard to find any negatives. Sure, they don't have as fantastic a sound as the recently tested Asus ROG Kithara, but those are aimed at a completely different audience. The ROG Delta II are strictly for gamers, and if it weren't for the annoying Armoury Crate, I wouldn't hesitate to give them a perfect rating.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      VseSmart.cz\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>03/16/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset media of VseSmart.cz\" href=\"https://vsesmart.cz/recenze/test-asus-rog-delta-ii-kjp-herni-sluchatka/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Score\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Without exaggeration, this is the pinnacle of aesthetic perfection; the same color palette used for the headphones lends it an almost angelic appearance. If there is a silicon heaven—and if angels dwell there—this is exactly what they look like! And that is, in fact, the only downside to this set. It is so beautiful that you’ll hesitate to touch it without white gloves, let alone put it to work in everyday gaming.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Score\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>09/28/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta II-KJP Gaming Headset media of Score\" href=\"www.score.cz\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}